      <keyword>Observation Geometry</keyword>
      <description>SPICE binary DSK file containing shape model of (162173) Ryugu based on ONC observations from 2018-06-27 to 2019-11-09 with Structure-from-Motion (SfM) method using ONC-T, ONC-W1, and ONC-W2 images, created by the Hayabusa2 Shape model team. The size and orientation of the model are adjusted to match the latest shape model by SPC (v20200323). This file contains about 50 thousand plates. Polygon arrangements of these SfM models are not following the ICQ system of the SPC-based models. The original name of this file was SHAPE_SFM_50k_v20180815.bds.</description>
